Andreas Jess and Peter Wasserscheid. Chemical Technology: From Principles to Products, second edition, Wiley-VCH, January 2020. ISBN 9783527344215. [Publisher description, complete contents, and sample](https://www.wiley-vch.de/en/areas-interest/engineering/chemical-technology-978-3-527-34421-5).

This additional commercial whole-book route joins chemical principles, thermal/mechanical operations, reaction engineering, raw materials/energy/environment/cost and twenty-four detailed process examples. Read the entire book if using it as the extended professional spine, with all relevant worked processes. The second-edition subtitle differs from the original An Integrated Textbook.

Authors, edition, release date, ISBN, contents and access status were verified against the publisher on 29 October 2026. The public contents/sample are not a freely licensed complete book; use a library, purchased edition or other authorized access. The free full texts/courses and technical books elsewhere remain substantial. No copy, figure or chapter is stored here.

